  "title": "Ex 9.25 · Does a | bc force a | b or a | c?",
  "prompt": "Statement: for all integers $a, b, c$, if $a \\mid bc$, then $a \\mid b$ or $a \\mid c$. This statement is false. Disprove it with a counterexample.",
  "answer_format": "Integer values for every variable, like a = 4, b = 2, c = 2.",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "tags": [
    "math123",
